      "ref": "bad-block-header",
      "why": "Targets consumers that validate a header EMBEDDED in the packet. This verifier never trusts an embedded header \u2014 it independently re-fetches the header from the chosen node \u2014 so the vector is unreachable through verifyProof. The same failure class (non-80-byte header) is covered node-served by adv-truncated-header-79-bytes (HEADER_INVALID)."
    },
