      "id": "proof08-bad-signature",
      "source": "proof08",
      "ref": "bad-signature",
      "why": "Materialized as adv-forged-signature: the corpus documents the construction (valid_bundle with signature.value := bad_signature_value); the adversarial file embeds that exact bundle so all three runners execute it identically. A drift pin in test/manifest.test.ts asserts the embedded signature equals the corpus bad_signature_value."
    },
    {
      "id": "proof08-signed-bundle-valid",
      "source": "proof08",
      "ref": "signed_bundle.valid_bundle",
